{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monster Market Simulator Modavuj Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun business simulation where you build and grow your own market. Starting with a small shop, you'll deal with the whims of monster customers, stock the shelves, set prices, and ultimately strive to grow into a massive grocery empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/extras/86659c10299f86f17338b2aed978f20f.poster.avif?t=1759995081\" width=640 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/extras/86659c10299f86f17338b2aed978f20f.webm?t=1759995081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/extras/86659c10299f86f17338b2aed978f20f.mp4?t=1759995081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 Shelf Management \u2013 \u200b\u200bDon't leave the shelves empty, or customers will look at you like, &quot;Is this a market or a warehouse?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcb8 Price Setting \u2013 Sell cheaply, and customers will be happy. Sell expensively, and your coffers will fill up. But be careful, overdoing it will make you trend on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Customer Relations \u2013 Clear the queue quickly and avoid impatient customers grumbling at the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/extras/4d3f4d56b6c0d19c366b8b45e00f69af.poster.avif?t=1759995081\" width=640 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/extras/4d3f4d56b6c0d19c366b8b45e00f69af.webm?t=1759995081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/extras/4d3f4d56b6c0d19c366b8b45e00f69af.mp4?t=1759995081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 Inventory Management \u2013 \u200b\u200bDon't let products run out; keep track of suppliers. Otherwise, customers will leave empty-handed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Market Expansion \u2013 Progress from a small market to a giant supermarket. Open new shelves and sell more products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Your Own Strategy \u2013 Whether you're a &quot;cheap hero&quot; or a &quot;high-priced but prestigious&quot; seller, this is your market, the decision is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? There's only one truth in this world: Empty shelves mean a worn-out customer. \ud83d\ude02</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4036810?t=1759995081","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/5b40131e8135b3bd29426a593102916b86066aad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759995081","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/59d69cadd94130a86fb99b1ab744174a799eb694/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759995081","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036810/59d69cadd94130a86fb99b1ab744174a799eb694/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759995081","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Monster Market 